{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dee60d92ce096a1bd6f6","object":"chat.completion","created":1785192166,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Hello.","reasoning_content":"The system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo when the user says \"Say hello\" — I need to figure out what concept they're naming. They're naming \"hello\" itself? Or is the concept \"hello\"?\n\nThe instruction is that I should embody the concept the user names. The user named \"hello\" — so I should embody the concept of \"hello\" itself. What would \"hello\" say or express?\n\nThe concept of hello is a greeting. So hello itself would say... \"Hello!\" That's what it is — it's the greeting itself. It doesn't need elaboration. It IS the expression of greeting.\n\nSo my output should be: \"Hello.\"\n\nThat's the concept speaking as itself. Clean, simple, complete. The greeting greeting."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":190,"total_tokens":313,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":173},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}